id: pm-test-measure-prerequisite
title: Expose the test measurement run prerequisite in help and recovery
description: "A real delivery workflow tried pm test <id> --measure focused_tests=76 and received --measure requires --run. Command help only says Record name=value evidence, and recovery points to generic item/help commands rather than an executable same-intent test retry. Preserve the fail-closed requirement, declare the prerequisite in help/contracts, and supply an actionable minimal recovery without weakening clone-local linked-test trust."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: agent-ux,"area:contracts","horizon:future"
created_at: "2026-10-09T20:48:23.014Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-10T19:50:50.463Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-10T19:46:30.139Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-10T19:46:30.139Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: Help and machine contracts state the run prerequisite; a measurement-only request refuses before mutation with an executable same-intent recovery; linked-test trust and sandbox isolation remain enforced; behavioral negative controls and generated surface parity pass without token budget relaxation.
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Declare --measure requires --run across CLI help, machine contracts and the SDK. Refuse measurement-only requests before mutation with a typed code and tokenized retry preserving tracker identity, selectors, measurements and explicit trust policy. Reuse a pure SDK argv serializer without importing Commander registration and preserve existing exported helpers."
expected_result: Agents discover the execution prerequisite and receive an executable same-intent retry without invented measurements or weakened linked-test safeguards.
actual_result: "107 linked tests and144 post-extraction focused tests passed; full local Node24 coverage before extraction was exact100percent across10111 passing tests. Final packed npx/bunx retries execute a trusted assertion and refusal checks preserve item/history bytes. Build, typecheck, generated surfaces and every static component passed with unchanged token, latency and RSS budgets; final-head full coverage remains a mandatory CI gate."
